OL,3,AHeating oil customers face tough winter
OL,4,Adespite shake-up promise
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith prices close to having doubled in
OL,7,Fthe past year, some campaigners have
OL,8,Fcalled for heating oil customers to
OL,9,Fbenefit from the same cap as regular,
OL,10,Fvariable gas and electricity tariffs in
OL,11,FEngland, Scotland and Wales.
OL,13,FBut there is no sign of the government
OL,14,Fproposing such a change, nor when the
OL,15,Fstricter rules will take effect.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
